window.products.push({"id":890040,"name":"NC Naturals Organically Grown White Sage Leaves & Clusters - One Pound","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m+MWSdngL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The White Sage smudge bundles included in this kit come from family farms in California. Committed to environmental responsibility, our farmers only grow organically and harvest by hand. California White Sage is one of the most sacred herbs among indigenous North American people. Smudging is a ritual way to cleanse a person , place or an object of negative energies, spirits or influences. The smudging ceremony involves the burning of special, sacred plants and herbal resins, then, either passing an object through the resulting smoke, or fanning the smoke around a person or place. The spirit of the plant then purifies whatever is being smudged. Note: We always ship our bulk white sage in protective outer boxes. While some breakage is unavoidable during shipping, this approach ensures you'll get more full clusters and fewer crumbles at the bottom of the bag!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m+MWSdngL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NC Naturals","source_asin":"B06ZZMQGP6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06ZZMQGP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06ZZMQGP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":890041,"name":"All Clad Grande Grille pan with 2 Red Mitts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ED7D39JKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description LTD Non-stick Grande Grille with 2 Red Mitts Amazon.com Distinguished among All-Clad's renowned cookware collections by its stylish charcoal-black hard-anodized aluminum exterior, the LTD line provides serious and professional cooks with all the virtues that make All-Clad's worldwide reputation unsurpassed. Key to its high performance is a three-ply, bonded construction. Sandwiched between the exterior and the interior lies a thick core of pure aluminum that spreads heat evenly across the bottoms of pots and pans and all the way up the sides. The striking exterior resists scratching, chipping, and peeling. Certain pieces, like this one, have two interior layers, one of 18/10 stainless steel and the other of scratch-resistant, professional-grade nonstick bonded to the steel. This enormous stovetop grill pan makes clear the appeal of All-Clad's LTD cookware to contemporary cooks. It's 20 inches long and 13 inches wide, perfect for grilling a dozen big burgers or eight T-bone steaks and searing them with appetizing-looking grill marks. Because the grill's cooking surface is durable nonstick, grilling healthful meals without using butter or oil is easy and cleanup's a snap. Polished 18/10 stainless-steel handles are riveted to the grill for strength, stay cool on the stovetop, and provide 2 inches of space to accommodate big hands. LTD cookware carries a limited lifetime warranty against defects and should be hand washed. Two red oven mitts are included. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ED7D39JKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B0007LBW72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007LBW72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007LBW72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
