window.products.push({"id":890151,"name":"Christian Byzantine Orthodox Greek Censer Incense Burner Liturgy (9991-b)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nON01uaQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Christian Orthodox Censer Dimensions : Height : 13 cm 5.11 in christian censer in bronze color Description: Censers are vessels made for burning incense. These vessels vary greatly in size, form, and material of construction. They may consist of simple earthenware bowls or fire pots to intricately carved silver or gold vessels, small table top objects a few centimetres tall to as many as several metres high. In many cultures, burning incense has spiritual and religious connotations, and this influences the design and decoration of the censer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nON01uaQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iconsgr","source_asin":"B00JQEHKOU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JQEHKOU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JQEHKOU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
