window.products.push({"id":890174,"name":"Oven Mitts and Pot Holders Set Kitchen Gift Set for Kitchen Cooking Baking, BBQ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UOb0ZNI2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do You Feel That A Pot Holder And An Oven Mitt Both Are Useful In Their Own Way & Prove Handy In Different Situations? You’re Confident That The Thanksgiving Dinner You’ve Put Together Is The Greatest Your Family Has Seen In Years. The Turkey Is Baking, The Green Bean Casserole Right Next To It, And The Pumpkin Pie Sits On The Cooling Rack By The Counter. Now, None Of This Would Be Possible Without Your Functional Oven, Or You Of Course, But It Also Wouldn’t Be Possible Without Your Oven Mitts Or Pot Holders! You Need High Heat Protection And A Strong Grip To Hoist The Turkey Into The Oven. A Great Cook, Such As Yourself, Deserves Great Kitchen Supplies.Safety With Flexibility – This Unique Set Of A Pot Holder And An Oven Mitt Not Only Helps You Handle Hot Pots, Pans, Plates, Casseroles But Also Offers You The Best Of Both The Worlds! It Cannot Be Denied That For Some Tasks Oven Gloves Are A Better Choice While Kitchen Pot Holders Excel At Some Other, And Both Of Them Used Together Can Do Wonders – Be It Pulling A Baking Tray From The Oven Or Picking A Hot Utensil Directly From The Stove – Achieve Pro-Like Dexterity!Ideal Gift – Struggling To Find A Good Gift For A Friend, Family Member Or A Colleague Who Loves Cooking? This Set Makes For An Ideal Choice, And Experience Tells Us That You Can Never Go Wrong With It – Be It Any Festive Occasion Or Just A Casual Gift.Easy To Clean – Safe For Machine Wash Too .Note – It Is Recommended To Use Cold Water For Washing The Mitt & Pot Holder, And That Too In A Gentle Cycle With Tumble Drying On Low. It Is Also Advisable Not To Bleach Them Or Run Them Through A Hot Dryer!Package IncludingGood Kitchen Cooking Helper, Ideal Housewarming, Thanksgiving Day, Birthday, Christmas, Mother'S Day GiftsMaterial: Polyester + Quilted Insulated CottonPattern: UniqueHeat Resistant To: Less Than 180℃ / 356℉Care: Keep Away From Naked Flame","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UOb0ZNI2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KZEMATLI","source_asin":"B08JYJGQ3S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890174","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JYJGQ3S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JYJGQ3S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
