window.products.push({"id":890313,"name":"WonderWorker High Non-Skid 3-Tier Spice Rack, Kitchen Cabinet Organizer, Expandable, Modern Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CE5hiPoEL._AC_SL1432_.jpg","description":"Have you ever tried to prepare a meal in a cluttered kitchen? It is tiring because your mind feels cluttered as well. You may end up ordering takeout for the day. A space saving rack is the best solution to declutter the working space. With the spacious 3-tier rack, you can almost be sure that all your spice jars will fit. You can place any type of jar including glass jars without worrying that the jars will slip and break. In addition, you can move the Wonder Worker spice shelf around until you find the most convenient position Sturdy Foldable Design The frame is sturdy enough to keep the rack in place even when all tiers are full of jars. The foldable design allows you to choose the number of tiers to use at any time. You can increase the tiers as you add more spices. In addition, it is easy to store the rack with the foldable design Anti-clip coating Are you worried about your expensive glass or porcelain jars? The anti-slip coating ensures your jars are safe and in place at all times. You do not need an extra rack or shelf for delicate spice jars Spacious with 3 tiers Each tier of the rack is spacious enough to hold multiple jars. Your spices are likely to fit in just one or two tiers Easy to clean You dot only need a neat kitchen but a clean working space as well. The ABS-plastic, TPR material is easy to clean and keep clean. Use the same soap and sponge or cloth that you use to clean your kitchen top Free standing design The mounted shelves in a kitchen limit your creativity when rearranging your kitchen. The freestanding rack can move to any space in your kitchen as long as it fits Versatile Here is another advantage of choosing the Wonder Worker 3 Tier Expandable Spice Rack. If you do not wish to use the racks for storing spices, you can also use it for storing cosmetics or toiletries!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CE5hiPoEL._AC_SL1432_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WonderWorker","source_asin":"B079Q2K39T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079Q2K39T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079Q2K39T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
