window.products.push({"id":890350,"name":"Comfort Zone CZ9BWT Portable 9\" 3-Speed Quiet Box Fan for Home, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QakA0lZsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Convenient Tabletop Design Keep small spaces comfortable with the targeted cooling power of this 9\" table fan from Comfort Zone. This portable box fan has a lightweight and compact design, weighing less than 3 lb. and featuring a built-in handle for convenient transport from surface to surface. The neutral white color blends easily into any decor scheme, making this a versatile quiet indoor fan for use in a kitchen, bedroom, office or dorm room. 3-Speed Fan Operation Help create a cool and comfortable environment at your desk or in your bedroom by optimizing air circulation and airflow with this portable box fan. An easy-to-use rotary dial on the front of this fan offers you a choice of three speeds to suit your space and your comfort level. This fan comes fully assembled right out of the box, so you just need to plug it in and choose a speed to start enjoying its portable cooling power. Safe and Quiet Operation Whether you’re using this table fan for home or office use, you’ll appreciate how its quiet and efficient operation prevents unnecessary disruption in your environment. Safe as well as quiet, this compact fan is equipped with a safety grill to protect fingers and other objects from the blades while they’re in motion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QakA0lZsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfort Zone","source_asin":"B073XJLWWD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073XJLWWD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073XJLWWD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":890351,"name":"Impeccable Lids Shaker Bottle Replacement Lid Cap Top - Upgraded 2021 Version - Leak Proof Design & Compatible with Rounded Flat Base Bottles (4 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Lvq3KYKZL._AC_.jpg","description":"*****FOR THE BEST FIT ONTO BOTTLES: PLEASE wash/use the lids up to 4x for the smoothest twist/fit. Have a brand new bottle? PLEASE was them in the dishwasher at least 2-3x as well for the smoothest fit.***** *PLEASE NOTE* These ONLY fit the flat/rounded base models of one name brand (most popular) shaker bottle brand (sizes 28oz & 32oz, NOT guaranteed to fit the 20oz size). Please wash the lids multiple times in the dishwasher before initial use - this will remedy any potential fitting issues. These lids only fit onto shaker bottles from ONE brand. Also, they DO NOT fit the Perfect Shaker Bottle Brand, Hydra cup, Shakeology Brand, Ice Shaker brand, Jax Brand, Blue Peak Brand, nor are they compatible with mason jars.Here at Impeccable Lids, we were extremely frustrated with the poor quality lids that come with most shaker bottles. Unacceptable, right?  After months of experiencing leaky lids when making a protein shake, I knew I needed to do something My mother cemented this idea in my head when she was furious that I got my protein shake all over the walls and floor of our house! And the last thing you want to do is clean up a mess after working your tail off in the gym! We are the only company that offers the perfect/most universal replacement lid for those lids that keep on cracking.  These have been specifically designed so they will fit well onto your shakers without any hassle, and most importantly, will not crack on you! We also know that lids can easily be misplaced. Instead of searching your entire house to find a lid, save some time, money (and the environment!) by having an extra replacement handy! This wide mouth, secure replacement lid is excellent for making protein shakes, smoothies, meal replacements, dressings, or pancake batter. The reliability you need for those lids that keep cracking as a result of daily use. BPA/PHTHALATE FREE & DISHWASHER SAFE","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Lvq3KYKZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Impeccable Lids","source_asin":"B0B9KHPHCJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9KHPHCJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9KHPHCJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
