window.products.push({"id":890659,"name":"2000W Portable Induction Cooktop,Sensor Touch Electric Induction Cooker Cooktop with Kids Safety Lock 8 Temperature and 8 Power Setting WIth Time","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mGrTqvyaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Portable and easy to store]: induction cooktop is designed with portable and compact concept, small size and light weight, very easy to carry and store, so you can easily use it in limited space or anywhere. Perfect for dorm rooms, studios, workplaces, everyday use, or as an extra cooking appliance in a busy kitchen. It's the easiest way to create sumptuous dishes. [8 power levels and 8 temperature controls]: 2000W power portable induction cooktop with sensitive large touch buttons for improved usability, with the light and sensitive touch screen you can set the temperature of the induction cooktop between 140 ℉o 460℉. You can also use the 3-hour digital timer, programmable for up to 3 hours with an automatic timer providing high precision operation. [Minimalist design and easy cleaning]:The full-page touch sensor control panel is intuitive to use. The high-end aesthetically pleasing glass panel with integrated LED display responds to gentle touch. When you are done using it and press the OFF button, the LCD screen turns off and goes to sleep without frequent flickering, giving you a most comfortable experience. The glass panel is easy to clean, just wipe it clean with a cleaning rag and it will look brand new. [Compatible Cookware]: Induction burners rely on induction heating, so they are only suitable for cookware with a magnetic bottom. Such as stainless steel, cast iron, or enameled iron. If no cookware is available or incorrect cookware is detected, the auto-detect function will indicate an E0 error code, simply put in the correct cookware and the E0 will disappear and work properly. Compatible with induction cooktops of at least 5 inches in diameter to ensure a large and even heating area. [Stability and safety]: stylish and elegant design, black polished crystal glass surface ensures excellent wear resistance and water resistance. The heating area and function area together with touch control buttons and flat LED display screen, built-in powerful cooling fan provides efficient heat dissipation and prolongs service life, fan sound is normal, please don't worry! Induction cooktop with child safety lock, avoid children or misuse, maximum protection for children's safety.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mGrTqvyaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Garlefel","source_asin":"B09DYKS9NG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890659","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DYKS9NG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DYKS9NG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
