window.products.push({"id":890683,"name":"DULONG Commercial Electric Griddle Flat Top Grill Hot Plate Stainless Steel Kitchen Grill Countertop with Thermostatic Control 2000W 22\"(Half Flat Pla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fSSQeEumL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Description 1)This electric griddle grill body make by good quality stainless steel,energy-saving and safety.2)With its energy efficient hotplate you get an even heat distribution of up to 300C on cooking surface,as well as accurate thermostats for ultimate control.4)Built in grease channel and catch draws grease away from your food for easy clean5)Splash guards protect the user and surrounding walls from hot grease and oil splatte Specification Type:electric griddle grillMaterial:Stainless Steel+IronVoltage:110VPower:2000WSize:55*43*21CMWeight:18.5kg Note 1.Do not touch the electrical heating floor to avoid scald when you use this machine.2.You should take out the plug or switch the machine was stopped,it could avoid the issue happen.All safeguard maintain work should be in process after shut down the power supply.If the appears hitch,do not dismantle by yourself,please contact us for repair. Pay attention 1.The surface of the Electric Griddle is coated with a layer of protective oil and covered with a piece of oil paper.When using for the first time,wipe off the protective oil with a cloth.Apply a layer of cooking oil and start heating the machine.2.This baking trays are made of iron.Iron will turn black after use.Please apply a layer of cooking oil after use,otherwise it may rust.If the color has changed of the grill plate after use,that is normal,not a quality problem!3.We use the shipping route of the sea,and may enter a small amount of water vapor during transportation.Therefore,it is normal for a small amount of rust on the surface of the machine or a small amount of smoke during use.4.There is no non-stick coating on the surface of the electric griddle,and it is normal for the sticking pot phenomenon during use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fSSQeEumL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DULONG","source_asin":"B07WXNRQWM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WXNRQWM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WXNRQWM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":890684,"name":"Kerosene Heaters, Kerosene Stove Heater, Kerosene Heaters for Indoor Use, Portable Camping Kerosene Stove for Heating, Cooking, Camping Oil Heaters (4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vLZS0Yn9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1.【No Electricity Needed, Efficient Heating】More Efficient Kerosene Stove. The combustion chimney of the indoor portable non-electric kerosene stove is made of special metal, which ensures that the kerosene is fully burned, and the heating is faster and more efficient. The Combustion Core is Made of high temperature resistant fiberglass and cotton yarn, more durable. Our kerosene heaters have 4 wicks. Bring warmth and joy to you, your family and your friends anytime, anywhere. 2.【Safety and Energy Saving】Portable kerosene stove heater without electricity. Portable kerosene stoves do not require electric heating. Compared to electric heaters, kerosene stoves can quickly heat a room without drying it out. All You Need Is Kerosene Heater And You Will Have Plenty Of Heat. Kerosene heaters are quiet, energy-saving, smoke-free, clean, environmentally friendly, The closer the distance, the higher the temperature. 3.【Long-Lasting Heating, Multiple Protection】It can stay warm for 15-18 hours at a time. Ideal for everyday supplemental heating needs and emergency situations. Features Flame adjuster, tip-over switch, and protective safety grills. Automatic safety shut-off and push-button start make it easy to light without matches or electricity. The top is designed with a removable enamel top, which is non-toxic and environmentally friendly. 4.【High Calorific Value】The maximum calorific value is 9000BTU/H (equivalent to 2800W), and the fuel consumption per hour is 0.2L/hr. It can quickly heat up a room of about 20-30 square meters. The new Kerosene Heater can be height-adjustable, which makes boiling water or cooking faster and more convenient. Reduced height, more compact and portable. 5.【Multipurpose】The Kerosene Heater is easy to Use, Portable handle design. The fuel gauge can check the fuel in real time, and the sealed fuel filler cap is safer. The rotary regulating valve can adjust the fire power and is easy to use. Kerosene Stove Heater can heat, boil, cook, and barbecue at the same time. Kerosene heaters can be used indoors, camping, gardens, restaurants, tents, balconies, ice fishing or picnics, emergency heat sources.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vLZS0Yn9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"vnekjse","source_asin":"B0BNPYLNJH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNPYLNJH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNPYLNJH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
