window.products.push({"id":890757,"name":"Karangrad Handheld Milk Frother With Stand,Uses Batteries, Mini Electric Frother For Coffee,Latte,Cappuccino,Hot Chocolate,Matcha,Durable Drink Mixer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61erwppIJ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Get Creamy Froth In No Time】: Karangard brings you a compact, portable handheld frother for frothing milk. If you like your morning coffee to have a lot of froth, then you'll definitely want to have the Karangrad frothing wand at home to achieve café standards right at home. This coffee/milk handheld frother works similar to an electric whisk and will give you maximum froth for any type of milk, oat milk, almond milk and soy milk. This includes butter as well as cream. 【Battery Powered】: Produces perfect froth in no time: the blender is battery powered so you don't have to worry about wires and finding an outlet. Heat the milk, immerse the espresso machine in the cup and turn it on. The coffee frother, an electric milk frother, will immediately start producing creamy foam on the milk. Within 15-20 seconds, your cup is filled with creamy foam and ready to go into your cafe latte. 【Quality You Can Trust】:Our electric manual frother, milk whisk is made of the highest quality stainless steel. It has a powerful motor that gives you 19,000 RPM, a double-spring durable long 18/10 food safe material stainless steel spiral mixer that won't rust or break over time and provides twice the power of other frothers and specialty espresso machines. A power button on top makes it easy to use. Low noise motor makes virtually no sound. 【Sleek Styling And Versatility】: With its beautiful red styling, this machine fits into any modern kitchen. It is lightweight and has ergonomically designed soft touch handles. It is easy to use and easy to clean. It can also be used to froth milk for other liquids besides hot milk. Use it to make milkshakes for your kids, or cocktails for your friends. It works well with both hot and cold liquids. 【100% Lifetime Warranty】: This milk frother is so convenient and practical that you can also give it to your friends and family. Let them enjoy the convenience of making chocolate or cappuccino at home. We have confidence in our product and know you will love it. That's why we back our products with a lifetime warranty and the amazing free bonus eBook is yours too. Order now and start creating thick, creamy froth for your homemade beverages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61erwppIJ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Karangrad","source_asin":"B0B195R23H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B195R23H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B195R23H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
