window.products.push({"id":890876,"name":"Yoga Pillow/Compact Yoga Bolster with Pillowcase, Very Firm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Br4uYEB7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural cotton, USA made PILLOWGANIC's unique 3 chamber design hold its shape. Inspired by handmade pillows found in Buddhist temples of Thailand. Our pillow bags and pillowcases are hand made in the USA. Cotton fabric: We use special tightly woven cotton fabric known as “Ticking”, This type of weave is specially made for pillows. The tight weave keeps the filling contents in the pillow and clean. This fabric is easily spot cleaned and also the entire pillow can be machine washed and dried. Cotton filling: Arizona is a major producer of cotton so we use local AZ grown cotton. Once the cotton is in our facility we use a process known as “opening” or “Batting” to fluff the cotton. Cotton fill has many benefits to synthetic and other fillings. Its quiet, it feels great, it breaths and keeps you cooler. Its a non synthetic organic material and eco-freindly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Br4uYEB7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PILLOW GANIC","source_asin":"B07K3QHDSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890876","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K3QHDSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K3QHDSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":890877,"name":"Trash Bag Holder, Garbage Bag Dispenser Roll Holder Trash Bag Dispenser Wall Mount, Grocery Bag Dispenser Compatible with Hefty Glad, Wooden Trash Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bxkUhfXgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🗑️High Quality and Stylish Appearance : Our trash bag dispenser is made of natural solid wood with safe black waterproof paint on the surface, which is strong and durable, you can use it for a long time. And the surface has white printing, which increases the aesthetics of the product. Trash bag dispenser roll holder can match any home style. 🗑️Have a clean home immediately : If you are tired of messy homes, cabinets and countertops, then hurry to use our trash bag dispenser holder, which can hold many garbage bags with large capacity. What a clever way to replace the old cardboard boxes with high-quality solid wood trash bag holder. The garbage bag holder saves you a lot of space and keeps your home clean and orderly! 🗑️Suitable for most brands : The size of our trash bag organizer is 10 * 5.9 * 5.8in. Please measure your garbage roll before purchase. Organizer will store Glad 13 Gallon Bags - upto 70 bags per roll. NOT compatible with Kirkland Costco bags. Compatible with Glad Bags Fits 10 Gal, 13 Gal (upto 70 bags), 22.5 Gal, and 33 Gal bag rolls. Note: Not suitable for super large rolls! 🗑️Wall Mount or Countertop Use : We pre-drilled 2 holes on the back side of this modern grocery bag storage holder so you can use it for countertop or wall, our plastic bag holder will not only help you to save space of your countertop or under-sink, will also add a great look to your countertop or wall. 🗑️100% Satisfaction Guarantee : We have always been aiming at providing the best trash bag dispenser, garbage bag dispenser for you. We are confident that you’ll like our garbage bag roll holder since we have put our love into it. Any issues, please feel free to contact us, and we will provide the best service to you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bxkUhfXgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VOOTTOU","source_asin":"B0C5HC6L9W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890877","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5HC6L9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5HC6L9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
