window.products.push({"id":890909,"name":"MeMoreCool Square Floor Pillow Seating for Adults Kids, Large Meditation Cushion Floor Pillow with Thick Foam & Soft Tufted Cover, Washable Big Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zXKsyk6BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Let It Inflate 4-5 Days] When the package is opened, this large floor cushion will be deformed and thin due to compression packaging. Please wait for 4-5 days, then the floor sitting cushion will be restored to its original thickness and shape! If you want to regain the thickness more quickly, please use a garment steamer, to bring the foam back to its actual height and remove sectional wrinkles from the cover [5 Inch Thick, Firm Foam Filling] The mid of the floor pillow cushion is filled with moderately soft and hard high-density foam rather than ordinary PP cotton, comfortable, flat, and durable. The oversized floor pillow has good comfort and can relax your hip and feet, a perfect square meditation pillow can be placed on your sofa, couch, bedroom, living room, outdoor patio, hanging egg chair, or swing chair [Super Soft Tufted Fabric] The big floor cushion pillow is made of breathable and comfortable velvety plush fabric, extra cozy to the touch, enjoy massage-like comfort even sitting on the floor. Modern farmhouse style, simple and elegant sewing stripe floor seating pillow is perfect for the floor, indoor or outdoor bench and chair. The solid color is your most suitable choice which is perfect for kids, and adult, even pet dogs or cats [Washable Square Floor Pillow with Zipper] There is a metal zipper on the side of the oversize floor cushion, the zipper is very long so removing and putting in the pillow filler is a breeze, the floor pillow cover can be put in the washing machine to wash, so the oversized pillow floor seat is easy to clean and durable [Convenient Handle] Handy handles are convenient to carry and move, so you can take the giant floor pillow easily. Square 24x24 inches, designed with solid grey color, this floor seat cushion can be used as a decorative pouf pillow, kids floor pillow cushion, adults meditation pillow, floor tatami cushion, or even pet dog bed, more comfortable and softer than sitting on the hard floor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zXKsyk6BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MeMoreCool","source_asin":"B0BLBT2CW7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLBT2CW7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLBT2CW7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
