window.products.push({"id":890952,"name":"Simple Flow - Double Mason Jar Glass Drink Beverage Dispenser includes METAL SPIGOTS - 1.5 gallons each","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gPMO9v2UL._AC_SL1493_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY: Two large beverage dispensers with 1.5 gallon capacity each forged from thick, high quality glass. Leak-proof, non-toxic, stain resistant, odorless and hygenic! METAL SPIGOT: Includes stainless steel metal spigot for enhanced durability. Makes serving easy and mess free with no leaks! (Ensure spigot is tightened before using) BEAUTIFUL DESIGN - Vintage style design makes the dispenser suitable for restaurant, home or office use. Great to use as a centerpiece on a serving table for parties and entertaining! Add sophistication to any restaurant, buffet or food presentation! EASY TO CLEAN: Large opening with clamp style lids make filling and cleaning the dispenser easy! LARGE CAPACITY: Each glass dispenser has 1.5 gallon capacity","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gPMO9v2UL._AC_SL1493_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simple Flow","source_asin":"B01973O3IA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01973O3IA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01973O3IA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":890953,"name":"Yifely Peel & Stick Shelf Liner Removable Furniture Paper for Covering Apartment Old Cabinets Drawers, Green Stripes, 17.7 Inch by 9.8 Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QsvbJ06+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features:1.Size: 17.7 inch(45cm) wide x 118 inch(3 meter) long, 0.1mm thick(Due to hand-made cutting, please leave a deviation of 3-6 cm.)2.Material: PVC paper . Paper Substrate:PVC resin. 3.Printing Technology: Water-based ink printing. Surface Workmanship: Textured.4.Function: Self-adhesive, waterproof, removable. Protect furnitures surface and inner，upgrade wall's looking. 5.Application: Dry and flat surface.6.Package Inclued: 1 X Shelf Liner RollATTENTION:1.Color tones can vary due to lighting in the room, pictures on wall for reference only.2.Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference.3. Wallpaper you will receive may have some wrinkles on it or both ends, but it do not effect looking after use on dry flat surface.4. Storage methods: stored at cool, dry and ventilated place. Because of PVC material, you can put it in a ventilated place to remove the vinyl smell. 5. If you buy more than two items, we may package your order into ONE ROLL with the toal length you ordered together in one parcel. But our other warehouse in local will send seperated roll.Installation:1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, board, wood cabinet,drawer,walls,window,glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature.2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water.3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is beter.4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth.5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QsvbJ06+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yifely","source_asin":"B06ZZH1ZJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06ZZH1ZJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06ZZH1ZJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":890954,"name":"Furinno Rossi Wall Mounted Shelves 3-Tier Rectangle French Oak Grey/Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LVlHXgLcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Furinno Rossi modern 3-tier wall floating corner shelf is manufactured from MDF material that gives it additional durability and extended life span. Comes in multiple colours for easy customization, espresso & French oak grey. The floating shelf has a modern design that will suit almost any decor. It is also decorative and functional for your home, office, or dorm room. Assembly is made easy with turn-and-tube design implemented, where no tools are required. Simple process by turning and twisting the poles against the boards and tighten them. Care instruction: wipe clean with clean damped cloth and avoid using harsh chemical to prevent damage to the furniture. All the pictures are for illustration purposes only; decor items are not included in the set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LVlHXgLcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Furinno","source_asin":"B07KBM965W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-890954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KBM965W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KBM965W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
